    "detailed_description": "Can you save our heroes from the virtual world?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Skill based arcade runner<br />\r\n- Collect and Upgrade 5 Different Characters<br />\r\n- Unique attack and jump abilities<br />\r\n- Cute pixel art and music<br />\r\n<br />\r\nViral Virar is an arcade running game. Try to reach the longest distance using the features of different characters, earn more with each run and improve your characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are very few people who can take the gold medal, track is deadly, how far can you go? <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your runner; PintiPanda, Melodi, Dumbledoge, Dora and Togi. Upgrade them to run even farther!",
